[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24901.19, "timestamp": "06:55:01", "text": "目的。但你需要做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24903.27, "timestamp": "06:55:03", "text": "下载被终止首先是登录"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24905.11, "timestamp": "06:55:05", "text": "如果你有一个GitHub账号，那么你想去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24906.708, "timestamp": "06:55:06", "text": "然后你想点击的操作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24909.51, "timestamp": "06:55:09", "text": "所有工作流程底层都使用了 gradalci。然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24911.27, "timestamp": "06:55:11", "text": "你想点击最新版本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24912.628, "timestamp": "06:55:12", "text": "这将是榜首"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24914.39, "timestamp": "06:55:14", "text": "结果。对我来说，就是这个了。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24915.91, "timestamp": "06:55:15", "text": "然后你要一直向下滚动到底部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24917.59, "timestamp": "06:55:17", "text": "一直到最底部，直到这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24920.39, "timestamp": "06:55:20", "text": "成品，你已经拿到了工具包和罐子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24922.15, "timestamp": "06:55:22", "text": "现在，如果您已登录 GitHub"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24923.67, "timestamp": "06:55:23", "text": "账户，就在最右边，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24925.35, "timestamp": "06:55:25", "text": "会看到一个下载按钮，点击后会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24926.868, "timestamp": "06:55:26", "text": "然后提供一个压缩文件，该文件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24928.39, "timestamp": "06:55:28", "text": "你可以敞开心扉。在那里，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24931.83, "timestamp": "06:55:31", "text": "终于找到了。已终止版本 0.01"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24934.868, "timestamp": "06:55:34", "text": "适用于 Minecraft 版本 1.20.1，即："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24936.788, "timestamp": "06:55:36", "text": "顺便说一句，唯一杀死人的版本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24938.27, "timestamp": "06:55:38", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24940.628, "timestamp": "06:55:40", "text": "现在。还有四个模组"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24942.31, "timestamp": "06:55:42", "text": "还需要安装。每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24945.35, "timestamp": "06:55:45", "text": "当然，其中一部分是在版本 1 中。为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24946.628, "timestamp": "06:55:46", "text": "等等，等等，等等，等等，等等，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24947.75, "timestamp": "06:55:47", "text": "求求你，求求你，求求你，求求你，求求你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24952.59, "timestamp": "06:55:52", "text": "请告诉我。请告诉我1.21。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24957.07, "timestamp": "06:55:57", "text": "请给我1.21。 1.21，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24959.628, "timestamp": "06:55:59", "text": "请。 1.21，"}]